    "text": "Ann Arbor\nPolice investigating after body found in Ann Arbor woods\nBy Jordyn Pair,\n8 hours agoANN ARBOR, MI — Police are investigating after a decomposing body was found in the woods near Ann Arbor. The body was found around 5 p.m. Tuesday, June 17, in a wooded area in the 400 block of S. Maple Road in Ann Arbor, said Chris Page, spokesperson for the Ann Arbor police.\n12",
